The real gh CLI uses isolated configuration and a disposable local HTTP endpoint. No production credentials are loaded.
$ gh auth status
exit=1
failed to resolve authentication token: Secrets are unavailable from Keychain. Unlock the Mac and retry. You can allow Automic Vault to access the needed Secrets while locked: enable Available While Locked for them in the Automic Vault app. Authorization is still required. Login and credential changes may still require unlocking. (-25308)
